			"notes": "- Waypoints in other dimensions now appear when you enter them.\n- User-made waypoints at the same position are no longer removed.\n- Fixed: a hand-made waypoint with the same name and position could be removed instead of the mod's own.\n- Waypoints you removed by hand are recreated while the Tempad location still exists.\n- Waypoints created by this mod are recognized by their name, position, initials and color. If you edit one of them in Xaero (for example change its color), it is treated as your own waypoint and a new one is created.\n\nFiles: NeoForge 1.21.1, Forge 1.20.1, Fabric 1.20.1, NeoForge 1.20.4, Fabric 1.20.4.\n\nRequires Tempad and Xaero's Minimap.\n\nBugs and questions: comment on the CurseForge page, or DM @kuronami333 on X."
